<title>UK: Eurotunnel shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel said on Thursday it had requested temporary suspension of its shares ahead of a crucial meeting of shareholders.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel has also requested trading to be suspended on the Paris and Brussels exchanges.</p>
<p>Shareholders are scheduled to meet in Paris on Thursday to vote on a debt deal to restructure its 70 billion franc ($11.8 billion) junior bank debt.</p>
<p>The deal would reduce current share holders' stake in the group from 100 to 54.50 percent.</p>
